# Preserved verbatim as the normative statement of the plugin's behavior.
#
# docs/design/diatonic-chord-trigger-v4.js is the Logic Pro Scripter script
# Springer is rebuilt from, and Phase 2 generates its reference vectors by
# running this exact file under Node. Prettier formats .js, so without this
# entry CI would demand a reformat of a historical record, and the vectors
# would then be measured against something other than what shipped.
docs/design/

# markdownlint owns Markdown, uncontested.
#
# Prettier reflows tables and normalises emphasis characters, which contends
# with MD060's aligned table style and with MD049/MD050. Two formatters with
# opinions about the same file is one more than can be satisfied, so Prettier
# keeps JSON and YAML and stays out of prose entirely.
*.md

